**{{Balance|Content=Kenji became available to play in the [[Training Cave]].|Change=Neutral}}
**{{Balance|Content=The Fruit Samurai Kenji skin was added. It was featured as a Misc skin.|Change=Neutral}}
*03/10/24:
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji became available in the Starr Road.|Change=Neutral}}
*04/10/24:
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji's Hosomaki Healing Gadget healing from recently lost health was decreased to 50% (from 75%).|Change=Nerf}}
*29/10/24:
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji's True Silver and True Gold skins were added.|Change=Neutral}}
*14/11/24:
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji's Super recharge rate was decreased by 35%.|Change=Nerf}}
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji's Nigiri Nemesis Star Power damage reduction was decreased to 60% (from 90%).|Change=Nerf}}
**{{Balance|Content=Fixed a bug where activating the Dashi Dash Gadget caused Kenji's attack to be only dashes after the duration was over.|Change=Neutral}}
*10/12/24:
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji's reload time was increased to 1 second (from 0.8).|Change=Nerf}}
*18/12/24:
**{{Balance|Content=Fixed an issue with Kenji's losing animation.|Change=Neutral}}
**{{Balance|Content=Fixed an issue with Kenji being able to knock the Ball out of the map in [[Brawl Ball|Brawl Ball 5v5]].|Change=Neutral}}
*02/01/25:
**{{Balance|Content=The Hebi, Mamushi, and Aodaisho Kenji skins were added. They were featured as Brawl Pass Season 34 skins and StarrForce Assemble skins.|Change=Neutral}}
*25/02/25:
**{{Balance|Content=All Gadgets no longer have 3 charges and now have cooldowns.|Change=Neutral}}
**{{Balance|Content=All True Gold skins were slightly remodeled.|Change=Neutral}}
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji's Super return location visual effects have been improved to be more accurate and visible.|Change=Neutral}}
*01/05/25:
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji's All You Can Eat Hypercharge was added.|Change=Neutral}}
**{{Balance|Content=The Cursed and Oni Kenji skins were added. They were featured as Battle for Katana Kingdom skins.|Change=Neutral}}
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji's Wasabi Power was added for a limited time.|Change=Neutral}}
*30/05/25:
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji's Wasabi Power was removed from the game.|Change=Neutral}}
*12/06/25:
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji's All You Can Eat Hypercharge multiplier was decreased to 25% (from 35%).|Change=Nerf}}
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji's All You Can Eat Hypercharge pull effect strength was decreased by 75%.|Change=Nerf}}
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji's All You Can Eat Hypercharge now pulls instead of knocking back enemies within 1 tile of the center.|Change=Neutral}}
*02/10/25:
**{{Balance|Content=The Kizu Kenji skin was added. It was featured as a Brawl-o-ween skin.|Change=Neutral}}
*28/10/25:
**{{Balance|Content=Kenji no longer teleports to the middle of his Hypercharged Super.|Change=Nerf}}
**{{Balance|Change=nerf|Content=All Hypercharges now give a 20% speed boost, decreasing Kenji's All You Can Eat Hypercharge speed boost from 25%.}}
**{{Balance|Change=nerf|Content=All Hypercharges now give a 5% damage boost, decreasing Kenji's All You Can Eat Hypercharge damage boost from 25%}}.
**{{Balance|Content=The Manga Kenji skin was added. It was featured as a Battle for Katana Kingdom skin.|Change=Neutral}}
*16/12/25:
**{{Balance|Buff|Kenji's health was increased to 4000 (from 3800).}}
*06/08/26:
**{{Balance|Neutral|The Grizzled Kenji skin was added. It was featured as a Windstock skin.}}
*01/09/26:
**{{Balance|Neutral|Every Brawler's movement speed was increased, increasing Kenji's movement speed to 855 (from 820).}}
*03/11/26:
